msgid "Balance Each corrects the colour of all {count} photos, each for itself: right when the light changed between frames.\n\nAverage balances all {count}, then gives every one the mean of their corrections: right on a series shot in one light, which should match.\n\n⌘Z only takes back the photo that is open; the others keep their new balance. The crop is never touched."
